# -*- encoding: utf-8 -*-
# Arc: PrisonArc | Scene: OutsideAndAlone

translate es strings:

    old "There is no place for me here, I'm sorry. Please, allow me to leave."
    new "No tengo lugar aquí, lo siento. Por favor, permíteme irme."

    old "Vaelen looks at Sarah. She sees an odd mixture of surprise and sadness in his eyes."
    new "Vaelen mira a Sarah. Ella ve una extraña mezcla de sorpresa y tristeza en sus ojos."

    old "The emotions quickly fade and gave way to anger."
    new "Los sentimientos se desvanecieron rápidamente y dieron paso a la ira."

    old "He rises up from his desk and points towards the door."
    new "Se levanta de su escritorio y señala hacia la puerta."

    old "Very well, Sarah. You have made your choice, and I will not keep you here against your will."
    new "Muy bien, Sarah. Has hecho tu elección, y no te retendré aquí contra tu voluntad."

    old "I will instruct the guards to let you pass, and you are free to go. However, you are not free to stay here."
    new "Instruiré a los guardias para que te dejen pasar, y estás libre de irte. Sin embargo, no estás libre de quedarte aquí."

    old "Sarah bows her head."
    new "Sarah inclina la cabeza."

    old "I understand, farewell, commander Vaelen."
    new "Entiendo, adiós, comandante Vaelen."

    old "Sarah turns around and exits the tent."
    new "Sarah gira y sale de la tienda."

    old "Not long after she exits, she hears Kate run up behind her."
    new "No mucho después de que saliera, Sarah oyó a Kate correr hacia ella desde atrás."

    old "Sarah, wait!"
    new "Sarah, espera!"

    old "Sarah turns around to face her old friend."
    new "Sarah se vuelve para enfrentar a su vieja amiga."

    old "Why did you turn him down?"
    new "¿Por qué lo rechazaste?"

    old "What did you think I was going to do? Sign up and become a soldier? I've never even punched a person in my life, let alone swung a sword."
    new "¿Qué creías que iba a hacer? ¿Inscribirme y convertirme en soldado? Nunca ni siquiera he dado un puñetazo a alguien en mi vida, ¡menos aún he desenvainado una espada!"

    old "If you put me out on a battlefield, I'd be dead in under an hour."
    new "Si me sacas al campo de batalla, moriré en menos de una hora."

    old "But...I could have helped you, trained you..."
    new "Pero... podría haber ayudarte, entrenarte..."

    old "Kate, I never wanted to be here in the first place."
    new "Kate, nunca quise estar aquí en primer lugar."

    old "You whisked me away to the other side of the world on a lie, and now my home is gone. I have nothing left."
    new "Me llevaste a la otra parte del mundo con una mentira, y ahora mi hogar ha desaparecido. No tengo nada más."

    old "When I think about Thomas and how he was alone when he..."
    new "Cuando pienso en Thomas y en cómo estaba solo cuando él..."

    old "Sarah couldn't bring herself to finish her sentence."
    new "Sarah no pudo terminar su frase."

    old "You did that."
    new "Eso lo hiciste tú."

    old "I never forced you to take my hand."
    new "Nunca te obligué a tomar mi mano."

    old "Sarah felt her anger growing."
    new "Sarah sintió crecer su ira."

    old "Fine, then don't even feel responsible for what you did. I don't need to to feel anything, I'm done with this place, and I'm done with you."
    new "Bien, entonces no te sientas responsable de lo que hiciste. No necesito sentir nada, estoy harta de este lugar y de ti."

    old "Sarah tried to turn around to walk away, but felt Kate grab onto her shoulder, pulling her back to face her."
    new "Sarah intentó girarse para irse, pero sintió cómo Kate agarraba su hombro y la jalaba hacia atrás para mirarla de frente."

    old "Sarah, you don't know what you're doing."
    new "Sarah, no sabes lo que haces."

    old "This city, this world, it's a dangerous place. You go out there alone, with nothing and nobody, they'll eat you alive."
    new "Esta ciudad, este mundo, es un lugar peligroso. Si sales ahí solo, sin nada ni nadie, te comerán vivo."

    old "I'm not as foolish as you imagine me, and I know this world is full of snakes, I'm looking at one right now."
    new "No soy tan tonta como me imaginas, y sé que este mundo está lleno de serpientes; estoy mirando a una ahora mismo."

    old "Then, for the first time in her life, Sarah did strike someone."
    new "Entonces, por primera vez en su vida, Sarah golpeó a alguien."

    old "Kate seemed unable to process the slap across her face, staring, stunned at Sarah as she walked away."
    new "Kate pareció incapaz de procesar el golpe en su rostro, mirando atónita mientras Sarah se alejaba."

    old "Something had broken between them, and it would not be fixed."
    new "Algo había roto entre nosotros, y no se arreglaría."
